ues/8519\r\n- Partially supersedes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/89193\r\n\r\nThis PR adds support for querying/getting the joypad type (gamepad, racing wheel, arcade stick, etc.) and model (Xbox 360, Xbox One, PS3, DualShock 4, DualSense, etc.). Getting the joypad type and model is useful, for example, to make the game use correct button names and icons for specific controllers.\r\n~~It's not currently possible to check if a joypad is a GameCube controller because our version of SDL doesn't support it yet.~~ Now it does, let me know if we should also implement a joypad model for GameCube controllers.\r\n\r\nTODO:\r\n- [x] `JOY_MODEL_STEAM_DECK` documentation\r\n- [x] Improve device type documentation\r\n- [x] Return `JOY_MODEL_XBOX_360` for other XInput controllers\r\n- `JOY_MODEL_GAMECUBE`, see also https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118147 (maybe we can do it later if needed)\r\n- [x] move `set_joy_device_type()` to `JoypadFeatures`\r\n- [ ] Test on Android after I fix controller model detection there\r\n- [ ] Test on Steam Deck (in both Gaming Mode and Desktop Mode)\r\n- [ ] Test with the new Steam Controller","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310664,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA2NjQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:input","name":"topic:input","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for a